# Copy to `.env` and adjust. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# The judge talks to any OpenAI-compatible endpoint — Ollama, vLLM, LM Studio,
# OpenAI itself. Changing which one needs no code change, only these variables.
# Full guide, including what leaves your machine: docs/judge_setup.md

# --- endpoint ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The /v1 suffix matters. Ollama serves its own API at /api/… and an
# OpenAI-compatible one at /v1; the client here speaks only the second.

# Lab DGX. The hostname needs the lab DNS; the address works from anywhere on
# the subnet, including from inside a container where localhost is not the host.
SCRNA_JUDGE_BASE_URL=http://lsbnb-dgx2.iis.sinica.edu.tw:11434/v1
# SCRNA_JUDGE_BASE_URL=http://192.168.81.7:11434/v1

# Ollama on this machine. A 65 GB model will not fit on a workstation card.
# SCRNA_JUDGE_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1

# OpenAI. Read the "What leaves your machine" section of docs/judge_setup.md
# first: the payloads carry marker gene names and cell type calls.
# SCRNA_JUDGE_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# --- model ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Measured against 12 cases with a known right answer — three payloads carrying
# a planted defect that must not pass, and cases whose correct verdict is known
# from the data. Two runs each, all four models interleaved in one session:
#
#   gpt-oss:20b    12/12   90.7s  no worse, but only ahead on one unstable case
#   gpt-oss:120b   10/12   62.8s  the default
#   medgemma:27b    8/12   67.6s  passed a 6x doublet rate; do not use
#   llama3.1:8b     6/12    6.9s  fast and wrong; do not use
#
# The small model was *slower*: the large one stays resident on the GPU and the
# small one is paged in per call. That is a property of this server, not of the
# models — remeasure after changing endpoint rather than assuming it holds.
SCRNA_JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-oss:120b

# --- key --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ollama ignores it, but the OpenAI client insists on one being set.
SCRNA_JUDGE_API_KEY=not-needed

# --- backend ----------------------------------------------------------------
# `stub` needs no model at all and is what the 463 tests use. `--judge local`
# on the command line overrides this for one run.
SCRNA_JUDGE_BACKEND=stub
